# The repro scripts under .kiro/specs/distill-contracts/repro are run inside
# Linux containers straight from the checkout. With core.autocrlf=true a Windows
# clone would hand them CRLF, and `sh script.sh` then dies on the literal
# carriage return, so pin LF regardless of the cloning platform.
*.sh    text eol=lf
*.mjs   text eol=lf
